o quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n in phi\u7871\'3fu c\'f4ng tr\'e1i do B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh.
\par  d) Th\u7901\'3fi gian g\u7917\'3fi b\'e1o c\'e1o quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n in phi\u7871\'3fu c\'f4ng tr\'e1i ch\u7853\'3fm nh\u7845\'3ft kh\'f4ng qu\'e1 m\u7897\'3ft th\'e1ng sau khi ho\'e0n th\'e0nh h\u7907\'3f}{
