\par  2/ Quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v\u7873\'3f ph\'e2n ph\u7889\'3fi v\'e0 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng phi\u7871\'3fu c\'f4ng tr\'e1i
\par  (M\u7851\'3fu bi\u7875\'3fn s\u7889\'3f 2a-2b/CTCT)
\par  2/ Quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v\u7873\'3f ph\'e2n ph\u7889\'3fi v\'e0 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng phi\u7871\'3fu c\'f4ng tr\'e1i bao g\u7891\'3fm c\'e1c ch\u7881\'3f ti\'eau:
