\par  - S\u7889\'3f phi\u7871\'3fu c\'f2n l\u7841\'3fi (ch\u7913\'3fa chi ti\u7871\'3ft the t\u7915\'3fng lo\u7841\'3fi, t\u7915\'3fng h\u7841\'3fng phi\u7871\'3fu)
\par  b) Quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v\u7873\'3f ph\'e2n ph\u7889\'3fi phi\u7871\'3fu c\'f4ng tr\'e1i do c\'e1c Qu\u7929\'3f ti\u7871\'3ft ki\u7879\'3fm t\u7915\'3fng c\u7845\'3fp t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f v\'e0 c\u7845\'3fp qu\u7853\'3fn, huy\u7879\'3f
