\par  c) B\'e1o c\'e1o quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n v\u7873\'3f ph\'e2n ph\u7889\'3fi v\'e0 s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng phi\u7871\'3fu c\'f4ng tr\'e1i ph\u7843\'3f}{\f46\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid3565378\charrsid14354794 i \'f0\'fd}{
